            <dl class="entrylist">
                <dt>
                    <a href="/blogs/ryanc/archive/2007/05/15/awesome-tool-of-the-day-baretail.aspx">Awesome Tool of the Day: Baretail</a>
                </dt>
                <dd>
                    <p>&nbsp;Every now and again I find a tool that changes my life.&nbsp; <a href="http://www.baremetalsoft.com/baretail/">Baretail</a>&nbsp;is just such a tool.&nbsp; I don&#39;t know what I did before, but it couldn&#39;t have been good.&nbsp; Baretail is a log file reader/watcher that trails the end of your log files.&nbsp; This may not be too exciting for you, but here in the <a href="http://www.speedway.com/speedyrewards/">Speedy Rewards</a>&nbsp;team, we have some terribly verbose 3rd party log files that are our only real insight into activity.&nbsp; This has made my week!</p> <p><a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/blogs/ryanc/WindowsLiveWriter/AwesomeTooloftheDayBaretail_8BB6/baretail-screencap%5B1%5D.png"><img style="border-right:0px;border-top:0px;border-left:0px;border-bottom:0px;" height="343" src="http://cromwellhaus.com/blogs/ryanc/WindowsLiveWriter/AwesomeTooloftheDayBaretail_8BB6/baretail-screencap_thumb%5B1%5D.png" width="425" border="0" alt="" /></a></p><div style="clear:both;"></div>

