                                | <a href="/blogs/ryanc/archive/2007/05/02/vista-sidebar-gadget-developer-experience.aspx#comments">2 comment(s)</a>
			                    
                            
			            
                                                
                        <div class="em"><span id="ctl00_Main_EntryItems_ctl05_ctl08_ctl01">Filed under: <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/blogs/ryanc/archive/tags/Vista+Sidebar/default.aspx" rel="tag">Vista Sidebar</a></span><input type="hidden" name="ctl00$Main$EntryItems$ctl05$ctl08$ctl01" id="ctl00_Main_EntryItems_ctl05_ctl08_ctl01_State" value="nochange" /></div>
